---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionIntro from '../components/SectionIntro.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact / 联系">
  <section class="page-intro">
    <SectionIntro
      eyebrow="Contact / 联系"
      title="Leave a clear way in."
      titleZh="为交流留出清晰入口。"
      description="The contact page is ready for the verified school, department, address, and email information supplied by the group."
    />
  </section>
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="page-shell contact-layout">
      <div class="contact-main">
        <h2>Start with the right details.<span>从准确的信息开始。</span></h2>
        <p>Once the group confirms its public contact route, this panel can link directly to an institutional email or official page. No form backend is included in this static prototype.</p>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/">Back to home / 返回首页 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-side">
        <h2>Information to add.<span>待补充信息。</span></h2>
        <div class="contact-lines">
          <div class="contact-line"><small>Institution / 学校</small><p>School and department · to be confirmed<br />学校与院系 · 待确认</p></div>
          <div class="contact-line"><small>Address / 地址</small><p>Campus address · to be confirmed<br />校园地址 · 待确认</p></div>
          <div class="contact-line"><small>Email / 邮箱</small><p>Official group email · to be confirmed<br />课题组官方邮箱 · 待确认</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
